    "sub_name": "輕鬆學英文",
    "sub_ename": "FUN ENGLISH STUDIES",
    "describe_ch": "此課程幫助準大一新生為未來的學習做好準備，除了閱讀、聽力和寫作等語言技能，將特別強調口語能力的培養，主要透過閱讀文章及觀看TED演講。此外，作業旨在幫助學生了解其主修、校園生活、永續發展目標以及技術應用。",
    "describe_eh": "The course, Fun Studies, is designed for incoming freshmen, providing insights to help prepare them for future studies. Along with covering essential language skills, such as reading, listening, and writing, the course places special emphasis on developing speaking abilities, mainly through reading articles and watching TED talks. Additionally, assignments are designed for students to explore their major, campus life, sustainable development goals, and technological applications.",
